# 17. What **not** to build

This is important.

## Don't build your own foundation video generator

Google, Alibaba, Tencent, Lightricks and others are spending vastly more compute.

Treat them as backends.

---

## Don't build your own general 3D generator

TRELLIS.2:

[https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS.2](https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS.2)

EmbodiedGen:

[https://github.com/HorizonRobotics/EmbodiedGen](https://github.com/HorizonRobotics/EmbodiedGen)

SAGE:

[https://github.com/NVlabs/sage](https://github.com/NVlabs/sage)

will improve much faster than you can.

---

## Don't build another 300 bespoke Platinum `.py` files

You already have **371 audited scenes** worth of raw visual grammar.

Mine them.

---

## Don't make Skia your canonical representation

Keep it as an excellent deterministic renderer.

---

## Don't build a giant conventional NLE

You need:

```text
ShotGraph
+
compiler
+
FFmpeg compositor
```

not a clone of Premiere.

---

## Don't make text prompts canonical

Prompts are implementation details.

Store:

```text
intent
entities
relations
state
invariants
camera
constraints
evidence
```

Then generate prompts from those.

